# Raw session transcripts are LOCAL-ONLY — never version-controlled or pushed.
# They are a recovery aid for Claude's memory and can capture secrets printed
# during a session. Keep them on disk, out of git. (History purge tracked separately.)
chat/*.md
chat/archive/
# ...but the small handoff IS versioned (no secrets, useful across machines):
!chat/LAST_SESSION.md

scratch/
.issue-body-tmp.md
